  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>tr_train_model_fraud - trains the fraud model, an H2O GBM, and saves it in train_model_output.
Run by jb_fraud_main_job; needs h2o-env.

1. csvi-customer_data, csvi-customer_billing, csv fi: customer transaction, csvi-fraud_details_report: CSV file
   input, the history: 200,000 transactions and the fraud report on each.
2. slkp-customer, slkp-transaction_details, slkp-fraud_report: Stream lookup, one row per transaction.
3. map-features: Mapping, runs tr_features.ktr, the features shared with tr_predict_fraud.
4. sv-convert_booleans_to_numbers: Select values, the eight features and reported_as_fraud_historic, the
   label as Number.
5. py-train_gbm: Python Executor, h2o-env's python.exe, All rows as train; an H2O GBM, up to 500 trees
   with early stopping, depth 4, learn rate 0.05, 20% of the rows held back; saves
   train_model_output/gbm_fraud.
6. wlog-model: Write to log, the five results.

Shipped data: rows_trained 160013, trees 150, validation_auc 0.9324, validation_aucpr 0.4061.</note>
      <xloc>352</xloc>
      <yloc>32</yloc>
      <width>627</width>
      <heigth>278</heigth>
